MGBh8FgqVMYgxGofse2DSeXvoe99bymd_ITUkh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR6Olzw3OA_KifHU1TJpRtlNCT8l6lEO2ezK5HeYoAhoQ&oe=6B0706CF"}, "display_name": "Mountain Rush: Offroad", "keywords": ["hillclimbracing", "climb", "offroad", "racing", "4x4"], "long_description": "Get ready for the ultimate off-road adventure in Mountain Rush: Offroad! Take control of a powerful 4x4 vehicle and race through five thrilling stages filled with steep hills, treacherous slopes, and unpredictable terrain. Each level brings new challenges as you climb mountains, leap over gaps, and maneuver across rugged trails.\n\nCollect coins and fuel cans along the way to keep your vehicle running and earn upgrades. Boost your engine, tires, suspension, and fuel capacity to conquer tougher courses and reach new distances. Every decision counts \u2014 balance speed with control to avoid flipping, crashing, or running out of fuel before the finish line.\n\nWhether you're racing for the best time or aiming to fully upgrade your ride, Mountain Rush: Offroad delivers addictive, physics-based gameplay packed with excitement and danger. With colorful visuals, smooth controls, and a variety of environments to explore, this game is perfect for fans of hill climb racing and off-road action.\n\nCan you complete all stages and become the ultimate mountain racer? It's time to rev your engine and take on the climb!", "short_description": "Mountain Rush: Offroad is an action-packed 4x4 driving game where you conquer rugged terrains, collect coins and fuel cans, and upgrade your vehicle for tougher challenges. Navigate through five unique, obstacle-filled stages with steep hills, jumps, and risky slopes. Test your skill and balance as you rush to the finish line in this thrilling offroad adventure. Can you master every mountain?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/fe9a5d0f-b060-47d9-85c6-d5a1a4d2747c", "developer_terms_